                                                                                [1 q[?1002h[?1006h[H[?25h[?25l[?1004h[?25h[?25l(B[m[23B[J[93mE1568: Terminal did not respond to DSR request for 'background' color. Startup m[H(B[m[96m//! The streaming optimizer.(B[m[K
[96m//!(B[m[K
[96m//! The optimizer keeps two copies of the state that escape sequences set up(B[m[K
[96m//! for later text: `desired`, what the input has asked for so far, and(B[m[K
[96m//! `emitted`, what the output has actually told the terminal. Sequences that(B[m[K
[96m//! only change that state are absorbed into `desired`. When something(B[m[K
[96m//! visible happens (text is printed, the screen is erased, ...) the(B[m[K
[96m//! attributes it depends on are brought up to date with the shortest(B[m[K
[96m//! encoding of the difference, then the operation is written.(B[m[K
[96m//!(B[m[K
[96m//! Operations whose effect we cannot model act as barriers: everything is(B[m[K
[96m//! synchronized first, the bytes are copied verbatim, and afterwards the(B[m[K
[96m//! state they might have touched is marked unknown.(B[m[K
[K
(B[0;1muse(B[m std::collections::HashMap;[K
[K
(B[0;1muse(B[m crate::Options;[K
(B[0;1muse(B[m crate::lexer::{self, Csi, Esc, Osc, Scan, StrKind, Terminator, Token};[K
(B[0;1muse(B[m crate::sgr::{self, Pen};[K
[K
[96m/// Mask bits beyond the pen fields defined in [`sgr`].(B[m[K
const LINK: u32 = 1 << 20;[K
